# Release And Handoff

- Source handoff zip path is `/Users/baegmyeongseon/Downloads/ApiViewer.zip`.
- Recreate the zip from scratch by deleting the old file first; do not rely on update mode.
- Exclude `target/`, `.git/`, `.idea/`, `.claude/`, `data/`, `logs/`, shell or bat launchers, jars, `mvnw`, root `application.properties`, `src/main/resources/application.properties`, root `repos-config.yml`, and `src/main/resources/repos-config.yml`.
